responsibleFromDate.heading = When did you become responsible for paying Council Tax for your home?
responsibleFromDate.guidance = You are responsible from the date you bought, or started renting, the home.
responsibleFromDate.hint = For example, if the date was 27 April 2025, enter 27 4 2025.
responsibleFromDate.error.required = Enter the date you became responsible for paying Council Tax
responsibleFromDate.error.twoRequired = The date you became responsible for paying Council Tax must include a day, month and year
responsibleFromDate.error.invalid = Enter a real date

bandReviewReason.title = Tell us why you think the Council Tax band is wrong?
bandReviewReason.heading = Tell us why you think the Council Tax band is wrong?
bandReviewReason.warning = Your band will only be reviewed if you provide supporting evidence
bandReviewReason.evidenceGuidance = The evidence you provide will be looked at before a case is opened. You should give as much detail as possible.
bandReviewReason.details.summary = What evidence can you include?
bandReviewReason.details.introduction = You can provide evidence such as:
bandReviewReason.details.bullet.1 = addresses of similar homes in a lower Council Tax band
bandReviewReason.details.bullet.2 = information about the sale price of your home or similar homes
bandReviewReason.details.bullet.3 = details of any changes to your home or the local area
bandReviewReason.provideEvidence.heading = How to provide your evidence
bandReviewReason.provideEvidence.guidance = You can type your evidence in the text box. You can use up to 1,000 characters. You can also upload up to 5 files including PDFs, documents and photos on the next page.
bandReviewReason.charactersRemaining = You have 1,000 characters remaining
bandReviewReason.error.required = Enter why you think the Council Tax band is wrong
bandReviewReason.error.length = Your evidence must be 1,000 characters or fewer

documentsToUpload.title = Do you have documents to upload as evidence?
documentsToUpload.heading = Do you have documents to upload as evidence?
documentsToUpload.hint = This could include screenshots of property listings, sale records, or other documents that support your request.
documentsToUpload.error.required = Select yes if you have documents to upload as evidence

